 pristine homes, and forgotten spaces. Behind locked doors, buried secrets are waiting for someone curious enough to look.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate the mystery at your own pace.</strong>\u00a0There are no quest markers. Follow any lead  and piece together a mystery that grows stranger the deeper you dig.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Or Just Stay Home. </strong>It's Friday night.<strong>\u00a0</strong>Your sister is playing VirtuaPets. Your friends are on SwordScape. You JUST got the GameSphere for your birthday. Forget all of what's happening and get lost online. Y2K isn't for another 3 years, anyway!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111050/extras/3f57da252617ebaee9617075428f9005.poster.avif?t=1771856137\" width=960 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111050/extras/3f57da252617ebaee9617075428f9005.webm?t=1771856137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111050/extras/3f57da252617ebaee9617075428f9005.mp4?t=1771856137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* (Actually, it's a lot faster than that. Don't worry about dial-up.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["coolmysterydev"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111050/header.jpg?t=1771856137","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> SteamDeck<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 or AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060